*> Second ACCTREC user — raises field-impact score for risk-gate demos.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ACCTBAL.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
    COPY ACCTREC.
01  WS-LEN PIC 9(2) VALUE 0.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
    MOVE "ACCT0002" TO ACCT-ID
    MOVE "500.00" TO ACCT-BAL-TEXT
    COMPUTE WS-LEN = FUNCTION LENGTH(FUNCTION TRIM(ACCT-BAL-TEXT))
    IF WS-LEN = 0
       DISPLAY "EMPTY BALANCE"
       STOP RUN
    END-IF
    DISPLAY "BAL-LEN=" WS-LEN
    STOP RUN.
